 'make-photo-comic-strip-readable':'Give each panel one story beat, arrange the photos in reading order, then add short captions. Test the finished strip on a phone so text and faces remain readable before sharing the exported image.',
 'draw-signature-transparent-png':'A transparent signature PNG is an image of a mark, not a certificate-backed digital signature. Use it only when the recipient accepts that workflow, draw a signature you are authorized to use, and keep the exported file private.',
 'layered-3d-text-poster-design':'Start with a short, readable phrase, then add depth and contrast without obscuring the letters. Check the PNG or SVG at the size people will see it; decorative layers should support the message.',
 'print-qr-code-quiet-zone-test':'Use the full intended destination, preserve the clear quiet zone, and test the actual printed code on more than one device. A static QR code keeps the encoded destination; styling cannot correct a mistyped address.',
 'export-pdf-pages-jpg-png':'Choose the required pages and resolution, export them as images, then check page order and filenames. Rasterizing a PDF preserves its visible appearance but removes selectable text, form fields and clickable links from the image copy.',
 'compress-pdf-structure-or-image-copy':'Try a structure rewrite when you want to retain document features. An image-based copy may reduce large scans but turns pages into pictures and loses text and interactive features. Compare both size and usability with the original.',
 'extract-pdf-text-versus-ocr':'Try selecting and copying a sentence in a PDF reader. An existing text layer can be extracted; an image-only scan needs OCR. Check reading order and accuracy after either operation, especially for columns and scanned pages.',
 'word-search-custom-list-answer-key':'Use a focused list of English A–Z words, choose a grid that can fit them, and review the normalized word bank and answer key. Check which words were placed before printing; recognition alone does not test independent spelling.',
 'crossword-words-clues-connected-layout':'Write clear answer–clue pairs first, normalize the A–Z answers deliberately, then generate the grid. Review intersections, numbering and any unplaced words before handing out the puzzle.',
 'sudoku-unique-solution-checker':'A completed Sudoku must use 1–9 once in each row, column and box. A unique solution means one valid completion; it does not certify a human difficulty level. Read conflict, checker and hint results according to their separate purposes.',
 'school-timetable-weekly-printable':'Set real period times and breaks before placing subjects, then verify the printed week against school hours. This is a manual planner: it does not automatically resolve teacher, room or resource conflicts.',
 'print-kids-worksheets-purposeful-practice':'Choose one clear practice goal, generate the matching alphabet, math, handwriting or coloring sheet, and inspect the exported PDF before printing. Adjust the amount of work to the learner; a worksheet is not a developmental assessment.',
 'habit-calendar-streaks-local-records':'Define a completed action before marking days, record consistently, and review the pattern rather than only the streak. Records are self-reported, and optional browser storage needs an exported backup if the entries matter.',
 'room-floor-plan-furniture-clearance':'Measure the room and furniture in consistent units, compare rectangular footprints, then verify clearance in the real space. No overlap on a plan does not guarantee usable access, structural safety or compliance with building requirements.',
