 'monthly-budget-planned-actual':'Use one period and currency, keep planned and actual amounts separate, and calculate leftover as income minus entered spending. A positive result can omit future bills; model payment timing separately when cash availability matters.',
 'ipv4-cidr-subnet-worked-example':'192.0.2.143/27 belongs to 192.0.2.128/27: 32 total addresses, mask 255.255.255.224, and conventional hosts 192.0.2.129–192.0.2.158. The conventional broadcast is 192.0.2.159. /31 point-to-point links and /32 host routes need different interpretations.',
 'chmod-numeric-permissions-explained':'For each owner, group and other digit, add read = 4, write = 2 and execute = 1. For example, 644 gives owner read/write and others read. Directory search, ownership and access-control lists also affect real access; do not default to 777.',
 'hmac-shared-key-message-authentication':'HMAC authenticates message bytes using a shared secret; it does not encrypt them. Match the algorithm, key encoding and exact message bytes when comparing results. Use demonstration keys for learning and keep production credentials out of examples.',
 'inspect-har-network-log-safely':'Treat a HAR file as sensitive. Review URLs, query parameters, headers and bodies before sharing, even after a sanitized export. A reduced export removes only its defined fields and can still reveal identifiers or private information.',
 'subscription-cost-monthly-yearly':'Convert charges to the same time scale and currency before comparing them. This model uses 52 weekly, 26 fortnightly, 12 monthly or 4 quarterly cycles per year. An average monthly cost is not an actual billing schedule.',
