 'unit-price-compare-pack-sizes-discounts':'Apply the discount to the pack price, convert quantities to matching units, then divide net price by quantity. Compare mass with mass or volume with volume; a larger pack is not automatically better value.',
 'cash-flow-opening-closing-balance':'Closing cash equals opening cash plus receipts minus payments. Carry that closing balance into the next period and keep timing consistent. An issued invoice is not cash received, and cash flow is different from profit.',
 'manual-inventory-stock-value-reorder':'Use a unique SKU, a consistent stock unit, a physical count and a defined unit cost for each row. Check stock value and reorder flags against those inputs; this manual list does not automatically update after sales.',
